---
// Template only. Update it to match the tools you actually use, and have it reviewed.
import Legal from '../layouts/Legal.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---

<Legal title="Privacy Policy" description={`How ${site.name}'s website collects, uses, and protects your information.`}>
  <h2>Summary</h2>
  <p>We collect as little as possible, use it only to run the website and deliver what you asked for, and never sell it.</p>

  <h2>Information we collect</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><b>Information you give us.</b> Your name and email when you contact us, join a waitlist, or make a purchase.</li>
    <li><b>Purchase information.</b> Order details provided by our payment processor. We do not receive or store full card numbers.</li>
    <li><b>Basic usage data.</b> Aggregate, privacy friendly analytics such as pages visited and referring sites, used to improve the website.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>How we use it</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>To reply to messages and deliver products you purchase.</li>
    <li>To send waitlist and product updates you signed up for. Every email includes an unsubscribe link.</li>
    <li>To understand which content is useful and improve the website.</li>
    <li>To meet legal, tax, and accounting obligations.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Cookies</h2>
  <p>This website does not use advertising cookies. Essential cookies may be set by our checkout or email providers when you use those features.</p>

  <h2>Sharing</h2>
  <p>We share information only with service providers that help us operate, such as hosting, email delivery, and payment processing, and only as needed for them to do that work. We do not sell or rent personal information.</p>

  <h2>Retention</h2>
  <p>We keep personal information only as long as needed for the purposes above, or as required by law. You can ask us to delete your information at any time.</p>

  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>Depending on where you live, you may have the right to access, correct, delete, or export your personal information, and to object to certain uses of it. To make a request, email <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>. We will respond within 30 days.</p>

  <h2>Children</h2>
  <p>The Services are intended for adults and are not directed to children under 16.</p>

  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>If this policy changes, the date at the top of this page will be updated. Significant changes will be communicated to subscribers by email.</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions or requests: <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.</p>
</Legal>
